{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961810/extras/483c4c3acc4f134340c0bce0f376caa0.poster.avif?t=1758505433\" width=620 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961810/extras/483c4c3acc4f134340c0bce0f376caa0.webm?t=1758505433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the ring and conquer the Championship!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucha Chess is a strategy roguelike with the flair of Mexican wrestling and the charm of retro cartoons. Instead of button-mashing action, you\u2019ll dive into chill but deep tactical battles, building the ultimate team of eccentric heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961810/extras/7eecfb22e31b84dadcfed6b8d5387a50.poster.avif?t=1758505433\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961810/extras/7eecfb22e31b84dadcfed6b8d5387a50.webm?t=1758505433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961810/extras/7eecfb22e31b84dadcfed6b8d5387a50.mp4?t=1758505433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless combinations of heroes, items, and relics to unleash broken synergies. Will you find the perfect balance between offensive power and defensive stall? Will you smash through the enemy frontline or strike straight at their backline? The choice is yours every match!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961810?t=1758505433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstati